In current R-devel, there is:

TYPEOF(x) == S4SXP

but also:

IS_S4_OBJECT(v)

The isS4 function in R :

R> isS4
function(object)
     .Call("R_isS4Object", object, PACKAGE = "base")
<environment: namespace:base>

goes down to IS_S4_OBJECT

#define IS_S4_OBJECT(x) ((x)->sxpinfo.gp & S4_OBJECT_MASK)

so it seems like the way to go about check that an object is an instance 
of S4 or not.

Romain

